; awali-mpya.mapishi -- jenga mbegu na mjenzi kutoka vyanzo vyake
; (msingi/awali.swm, msingi/mfululizo/mjenzi.swm) bila kulinganisha na
; vilivyogandishwa: jengo/awali na jengo/mjenzi. Tumia kujaribu mabadiliko
; KABLA ya kugandisha (CONTRIBUTING.md, sheria ya mzizi wa uaminifu).
endesha msingi/mjenzi.bin gharama/kusanyiko.mapishi
endesha jengo/kusanyiko < msingi/awali.swm > jengo/awali
endesha jengo/kusanyiko < msingi/mfululizo/mjenzi.swm > jengo/mjenzi
